        <mxCell id="5NoyTFmbiUV2HVWiRSmj-117" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;p data-start=&quot;797&quot; data-end=&quot;985&quot; style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(27, 29, 30); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Redis maintains counters like:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(27, 29, 30); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;987&quot; data-end=&quot;1017&quot; style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(27, 29, 30); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full my-4&quot; style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot; style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot; style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot; style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot; style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot; style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot; style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pt-3&quot; style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot; style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼk ͼy&quot; style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot; style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly&quot; style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important;&quot;&gt;video:{video_id}:likes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1019&quot; data-end=&quot;1210&quot; style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(27, 29, 30); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;When a user clicks like, we increment the Redis counter instead of updating the main database immediately. This allows the system to handle millions of likes per second with very low latency.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1212&quot; data-end=&quot;1321&quot; style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(27, 29, 30); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Periodically, a background worker aggregates the Redis counters and updates the persistent metadata database.&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="560" x="1200" y="4350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
